## Lore

Pucara mind mages are the giants'' greatest psychics, schooled in special
monasteries to be warrior and mystic at once. They command the stone powers of
their race and, unlike ordinary Pucara, the super-psionic abilities as well.

They are rare - about one giant in a hundred - and a war band seldom carries
more than one unless its mission matters greatly. Many rise to be chieftains
or kings, and harming one is counted among the gravest insults that can be
offered to the whole race.
', 'published', 'data-script'
